[63.342858, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mModel: claude-sonnet-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ami-demo-14eZri\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-152831-429-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Type \u001b[1m/\u001b[22m to see available slash commands.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Activate your impeccable skill, then create index.html in the current directory containing a \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255msingle plain HTML button labeled 'Get Started'. Redesign that button to be visually polished and \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mfully accessible \u2014 rounded corners, clear focus ring, good color contrast, hover state, and semantic\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m markup \u2014 all in one self-contained file with inline CSS. Finally, print a one-line summary of the \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mimprovements you made. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll activate the impeccable skill and create a polished, accessible button for you.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"impeccable\" activated inline. Following ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #2\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;13