[119.061096, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mfully accessible \u2014 rounded corners, clear focus ring, good color contrast, hover state, and semantic\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m markup \u2014 all in one self-contained file with inline CSS. Finally, print a one-line summary of the \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mimprovements you made. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll activate the impeccable skill and create a polished, accessible button for you.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"impeccable\" activated inline. Following ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #2\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll create the button and apply the impeccable design standards. Let me first check the current\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kdirectory and load the necessary references.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan list_dir(Contents of /tmp/ami-demo-14eZri: (1 entries)) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mbash(skill directory not set) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #3\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KContext loading did not run; I'll read the existing project context directly.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(No .md files in current directory) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mglob(No files found matching p